  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates><x>0</x><y>760</y><w>1020</w><h>90</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Course specification layer -&gt; FreshFlow package: Presentation = presentation; Service = application; Domain = domain; Data Access (infrastructure) =
infrastructure, which also holds the Kafka bindings, mappers and configuration. Dependency rule (spec-01 s2.2): presentation -&gt; application -&gt; domain
&lt;- infrastructure; the domain package imports nothing (no Spring, JPA, Jackson or Kafka). Repository interfaces are declared in
infrastructure.repository with their JPA implementations beside them (subject coordinator's ruling, ADR 0005).
bg=#FFFBE6</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
